{"id":"4998dc488f84d2d6","group":"29","path":"29/29-ex-zero-one-constant.md","title":"加入一个常量即可破坏零一律","display":"ex-zero-one-constant — 加入一个常量即可破坏零一律","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-ex-zero-one-constant","aliases":["29-ex-zero-one-constant"],"display":"ex-zero-one-constant — 加入一个常量即可破坏零一律","depends_on":["[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Eq.(6.42), p.109, DjVu scan 124","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-ex-zero-one-constant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-ex-zero-one-constant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-zero-one-constant — 加入一个常量即可破坏零一律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e0b02880da0dad2\" href=\"?note=7e0b02880da0dad2\" title=\"29-df-asymptotic-prob\">29-df-asymptotic-prob</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Eq.(6.42), p.109, DjVu scan 124"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_c=\\langle E^{(2)},c\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_c=\\langle E^{(2)},c\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是任意二元关系，允许自环；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是一个常量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}\">\\(\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}\\)</span> 对所有论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_c\">\\(\\tau_c\\)</span>-结构取均匀概率；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_c\\coloneqq E(c,c)\">\\(\\varphi_c\\coloneqq E(c,c)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau_c]|=n\\,2^{n^2},\\qquad|\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau_c]\\mid A\\models\\varphi_c\\}|=n\\,2^{n^2-1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau_c]|=n\\,2^{n^2},\\qquad|\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau_c]\\mid A\\models\\varphi_c\\}|=n\\,2^{n^2-1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}(\\varphi_c)=\\frac12,\\qquad\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}(\\varphi_c)=\\frac12\\notin\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}(\\varphi_c)=\\frac12,\\qquad\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}(\\varphi_c)=\\frac12\\notin\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书式 (6.42)，印刷页 109，扫描页 124，将原书记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的常量改名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^A\">\\(c^A\\)</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(c^A,c^A)\">\\(E(c^A,c^A)\\)</span> 是一个独立公平关系位；翻转这个位给出满足与不满足之间的双射。已核对原书等式及本条计数证明。这里允许自环，不能把该例套到无环简单图上。此反例解释零一律为何必须排除常量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-asymptotic-prob","status":"resolved","id":"7e0b02880da0dad2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-asymptotic-prob]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau_c=\\langle E^{(2)},c\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_c\\coloneqq E(c,c)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau_c]|=n\\,2^{n^2},\\qquad|\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}_n[\\tau_c]\\mid A\\models\\varphi_c\\}|=n\\,2^{n^2-1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}(\\varphi_c)=\\frac12,\\qquad\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\mu_{\\tau_c,n}(\\varphi_c)=\\frac12\\notin\\{0,1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"c^A","display":false},{"tex":"E(c^A,c^A)","display":false}],"bytes":1449,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-bounded-variable-zero-one]]、[[29-ex-zero-one-constant]] — 句子集零一律及加入常量的反例"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-ex-zero-one-constant]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-ex-zero-one-constant|29-ex-zero-one-constant]]"}],"outgoing":["7e0b02880da0dad2","28e86a5f0243a0ae","3ee556c64b16809b"]}